  "findings": [
    "Scanned five HTML templates have no explicit matTabContent, animationDone, preserveContent or animationDuration use.",
    "selectedIndexChange handlers occur in account-contacts and account-register; scanned source does not establish whole-app lifecycle timing independence.",
    "Existing selectors include mat-tab-body, mat-tab-body.mat-tab-body-active > div, .mat-tab-body-wrapper and .mat-tab-label; tabs changes retain these structures/selectors and require no CSS/SCSS edit in the inspected consumers.",
    "Account-contacts intentionally hides .mat-tab-body-wrapper with display:none!important; account-register overrides active body/direct-child overflow.",
    "No .mat-tab-body-content transform/transition override found in these component styles or shared/css sources."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No Cyph file modified.",
    "No Cyph build/runtime/integration executed. Final upgraded-consumer and release gates remain required.",
    "Product TypeScript is undergoing a further stale-end correction; this report qualifies unchanged templates/styles at the listed HEADs only, not final motion source."
  ],
